[2026-02-04T17:24:49.329Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UFdmS2ZEoLKGqTh4oE7eha","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amazon layoffs 30000 corporate jobs 2026 January workforce reduction\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Amazon layoffs hit nearly 2,200 in Washington state, more than half in core product and engineering roles – GeekWire\",\"url\":\"https://www.geekwire.com/2026/amazon-layoffs-hit-nearly-2200-in-washington-state-more-than-half-in-core-product-and-engineering-roles/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon layoffs set to hit Washington corporate workforce hard as AI reliance grows\",\"url\":\"https://komonews.com/news/local/amazon-layoffs-set-to-hit-washington-corporate-workforce-hard-as-ai-reliance-grows-artificial-intelligence-office-fulfilment-center-prime-order-2-day-shipping-seattl-customer-service-downtown-hr-tech-it-economy-jobs\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon announces new corporate layoffs as AI shifts workforce priorities in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://kmph.com/news/local/amazon-announces-new-corporate-layoffs-as-ai-shifts-workforce-priorities-in-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Why Amazon layoffs could hit 30000 roles by May 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.thehrdigest.com/why-amazon-layoffs-could-hit-30000-roles-by-may-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon layoffs: 16,000 jobs to be cut in latest anti-bureaucracy push\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/01/28/amazon-layoffs-anti-bureaucracy-ai.html\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon's layoffs are staggering. We've seen this before\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnn.com/2026/01/31/tech/amazon-layoffs-january-tech-changes\"},{\"title\":\"Aboutamazon\",\"url\":\"https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-layoffs-corporate-jan-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon confirms 16000 more corporate job cuts, bringing ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.geekwire.com/2026/amazon-confirms-16000-more-job-cuts-bringing-total-layoffs-to-30000-since-october/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon announces thousands of new layoffs as corporate and tech jobs bloodbath continues into new year - World Socialist Web Site\",\"url\":\"https://www.wsws.org/en/articles/2026/01/26/eyin-j26.html\"},{\"title\":\"Sweeping Amazon layoffs slated for next week, reports say\",\"url\":\"https://www.seattletimes.com/business/amazon/sweeping-amazon-layoffs-slated-for-next-week-reuters-reports/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Amazon's layoffs and workforce reduction:\n\n## Amazon Layoffs Summary\n\nAmazon announced company-wide layoffs that impact 16,000 corporate employees globally, and combined with a 14,000-worker layoff in October, it's the largest corporate workforce reduction in the company's history.\n\n**Potential 30,000 Figure:**\n\nWhile 14,000 job cuts at Amazon were confirmed late last year, insiders suggest the total 'ripple effect' could hit 30,000 roles by May 2026. Additionally, Amazon announced a second round of job cuts as part of its goal of laying off 30,000 employees.\n\n**Timeline and Details:**\n\nWorker Adjustment and Retraining Notification (WARN) notices filed in Washington, California and others specify separations starting January 26, and continuing through May, with these layoffs targeting managerial and corporate positions.\n\n**Reason Behind Cuts:**\n\nThe layoffs are part of a massive restructuring plan in 2026 to cut corporate bureaucracy, increase individual contributor ratio, and pour billions into AI and AWS data centers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"c2138bd8-7de8-4128-a361-d77a8c6df9a1","tool_use_result":{"query":"Amazon layoffs 30000 corporate jobs 2026 January workforce reduction","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01St5GTHd5Eo6xgQ7mDhSBoQ","content":[{"title":"Amazon layoffs hit nearly 2,200 in Washington state, more than half in core product and engineering roles – GeekWire",