mazon announced company-wide layoffs that impact 16,000 corporate employees globally, and combined with a 14,000-worker layoff in October, it's the largest corporate workforce reduction in the company's history.\n\n**Potential 30,000 Figure:**\n\nWhile 14,000 job cuts at Amazon were confirmed late last year, insiders suggest the total 'ripple effect' could hit 30,000 roles by May 2026. Additionally, Amazon announced a second round of job cuts as part of its goal of laying off 30,000 employees.\n\n**Timeline and Details:**\n\nWorker Adjustment and Retraining Notification (WARN) notices filed in Washington, California and others specify separations starting January 26, and continuing through May, with these layoffs targeting managerial and corporate positions.\n\n**Reason Behind Cuts:**\n\nThe layoffs are part of a massive restructuring plan in 2026 to cut corporate bureaucracy, increase individual contributor ratio, and pour billions into AI and AWS data centers."],"durationSeconds":6.6988456}}
[2026-02-04T17:24:49.707Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U9Nqx2ToBBeVjeSGK2XSWe","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amazon 14000 layoffs October 2025 16000 cuts 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Amazon layoffs: 16,000 jobs to be cut in latest anti-bureaucracy push\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/01/28/amazon-layoffs-anti-bureaucracy-ai.html\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon Reportedly Set to Lay Off Another 14K Workers\",\"url\":\"https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-amazon-expected-to-announce-round-of-layoffs-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon cuts 16000 jobs in historic wave of layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://www.spokesman.com/stories/2026/jan/28/amazon-cuts-16000-jobs-in-historic-wave-of-layoffs/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon Layoffs Discussions - Blind\",\"url\":\"https://www.teamblind.com/company/Amazon/posts/amazon-layoffs\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon confirms 16000 more corporate job cuts, bringing ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.geekwire.com/2026/amazon-confirms-16000-more-job-cuts-bringing-total-layoffs-to-30000-since-october/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon confirms 14,000 corporate job cuts, says push for 'efficiency gains' will continue into 2026 – GeekWire\",\"url\":\"https://www.geekwire.com/2025/amazon-confirms-14000-corporate-job-cuts-says-push-for-efficiency-gains-will-continue-into-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon Set for Massive Global Layoffs: Up to 16000 ...\",\"url\":\"https://sundayguardianlive.com/world/amazon-set-for-massive-global-layoffs-up-to-16000-corporate-jobs-at-risk-next-week-165990/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon Confirms It’s Slashing 14,000 Jobs, Anticipates More Layoffs In 2026\",\"url\":\"https://deadline.com/2025/10/amazon-slashing-housands-of-corporate-jobs-reuters-report-1236599112/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon cuts 16000 corporate jobs as part of major AI restructuring | Technobezz\",\"url\":\"https://www.technobezz.com/news/amazon-cuts-16000-corporate-jobs-as-part-of-major-ai-restruc-2026-02-04-wrmk\"},{\"title\":\"Why Amazon layoffs could hit 30,000 roles by May 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.thehrdigest.com/why-amazon-layoffs-could-hit-30000-roles-by-may-2026\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what happened with Amazon's recent layoffs:\n\n## October 2025 Layoffs\n\nIn October 2025, Amazon laid off 14,000 employees across its corporate workforce. At the time, the company indicated the cuts would continue in 2026 as it found \"additional places we can remove layers.\"\n\n## January 2026 Layoffs\n\nIn January 2026, Amazon's head of resources Beth Galetti told employees in a memo that the company was cutting 16,000 corporate roles. This brought Amazon's four-month layoff total to 30,000 as the tech giant restructured for AI competition.\n\n## Rationale and Context\n\nAmazon's Galetti stated that reducing layers, increasing ownership, and removing bureaucracy were driving the cuts. CEO Andy Jassy said that efficiency gains from AI would likely cause Amazon's corporate head count to fall in the coming years. \n\nAmazon has been cutting costs across its business so that it can invest more in AI and the rapid build-out of data centers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"037aa17c-fb14-4838-97ad-a9c68ed2d301","tool_use_result":{"query":"Amazon 14000 layoffs October 2025 16000 cuts 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01K9dAcmaBqNu489pBnnq8KD","content":[{"title":"Amazon layoffs: 16,000 jobs to be cut in latest anti-bureaucracy push","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/01/28/amazon-layoffs-anti-bureaucracy-ai.html"},{"title":"Amazon Reportedly Set to Lay Off Another 14K Workers","url":"https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-amazon-expected-to-announce-round-of-layoffs-2026/"},{"title":"Amazon cuts 16000 jobs in historic wave of layoffs","url":"https://www.spokesman.com/stories/2026/jan/28/amazon-cuts-16000-jobs-in-historic-wave-of-layoffs/"},{"title":"Amazon Layoffs Discussions - Blind","url":"https://www.teamblind.com/company/Amazon/posts/amazon-layoffs"},{"title":"Amazon confirms 16000 more corporate job cuts, bringing ...","url":"https://www.geekwire.com/2026/amazon-confirms-16000-more-job-cuts-bringing-total-layoffs-to-30000-since-october/"},{"title":"Amazon confirms 14,000 corporate job cuts, says push for 'efficiency gains' will continue into 2026 – GeekWire","url":"https://www.geekwire.com/2025/amazon-confirms-14000-corporate-job-cuts-says-push-for-efficiency-gains-will-continue-into-2026/"},{"title":"Amazon Set for Massive Global Layoffs: Up to 16000 ...","url":"https://sundayguardianlive.com/world/amazon-set-for-massive-global-layoffs-up-to-16000-corporate-jobs-at-risk-next-week-165990/"},{"title":"Amazon Confirms It’s Slashing 14,000 Jobs, Anticipates More Layoffs In 2026","url":"https://deadline.com/2025/10/amazon-slashing-housands-of-corporate-jobs-reuters-report-1236599112/"},{"title":"Amazon cuts 16000 corporate jobs as part of major AI restructuring | Technobezz","url":"https://www.technobezz.com/news/amazon-cuts-16000-corporate-jobs-as-part-of-major-ai-restruc-2026-02-04-wrmk"},{"title":"Why Amazon layoffs could hit 30,000 roles by May 2026","url":"https://www.thehrdigest.com/why-amazon-layoffs-could-hit-30000-roles-by-may-2026"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what happened with Amazon's recent layoffs:\n\n## October 2025 Layoffs\n\nIn October 2025, Amazon laid off 14,000 employees across its corporate workforce. At the time, the company indicated the cuts would continue in 2026 as it found \"additional places we can remove layers.\"\n\n## January 2026 Layoffs\n\nIn January 2026, Amazon's head of resources Beth Galetti told employees in a memo that the company was cutting 16,000 corporate roles. This brought Amazon's four-month layoff total to 30,000 as the tech giant restructured for AI competition.\n\n## Rationale and Context\n\nAmazon's Galetti stated that reducing layers, increasing ownership, and removing bureaucracy were driving the cuts. CEO Andy Jassy said that efficiency gains from AI would likely cause Amazon's corporate head count to fall in the coming years. \n\nAmazon has been cutting costs across its business so that it can invest more in AI and the rapid build-out of data centers."],"durationSeconds":6.679055700000001}}
