Economic Uncertainty | The AI Journal\",\"url\":\"https://aijourn.com/resume-org-survey-6-in-10-companies-plan-to-lay-off-employees-in-2026-amid-economic-uncertainty/\"},{\"title\":\"6 in 10 Companies Plan To Lay Off Employees in 2026 Amid Economic Uncertainty - Resume.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.resume.org/6-in-10-companies-plan-to-lay-off-employees-in-2026-amid-economic-uncertainty/\"},{\"title\":\"Resume.org Survey: 6 in 10 Companies Plan To Lay Off Employees in 2026 Amid Economic Uncertainty\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/resumeorg-survey-6-in-10-companies-plan-to-lay-off-employees-in-2026-amid-economic-uncertainty-302559155.html\"},{\"title\":\"6 in 10 Companies Are Planning Layoffs in 2026 Due to Economic Uncertainty, Survey Finds - CPA Practice Advisor\",\"url\":\"https://www.cpapracticeadvisor.com/2025/09/18/6-in-10-companies-are-planning-layoffs-in-2026-due-to-economic-uncertainty-survey-finds/169258/\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found information about the Resume.org survey related to your query. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Survey Findings\n\nMore than half of hiring managers (55%) say their company expects layoffs next year. Companies cite AI (44%), reorganization or restructuring (42%), and budget constraints (39%) as the top drivers of layoffs.\n\n## Methodology\n\nResume.org conducted a survey of 1,000 U.S. hiring managers, with respondents screened to ensure they held management-level positions and were knowledgeable about employment and staffing plans.\n\n## Additional Context on AI's Role\n\nWhile AI is cited as a driver by 44% of companies, only 9% say AI has fully replaced certain roles, while 45% say it has partially reduced the need for new hires and another 45% report little to no impact on staffing levels. Notably, 59% admit they emphasize AI when explaining hiring freezes or layoffs because it plays better with stakeholders than citing financial constraints.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"c37d751c-701b-439e-ab19-0f709d966f7e","tool_use_result":{"query":"Resume.org survey 2026 layoffs AI driver 44% 55% methodology hiring managers","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0142jzKT728A4MJeYacDp5Ju","content":[{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/resumeorg-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs-302654255.html"},{"title":"The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs - Resume.org","url":"https://www.resume.org/the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs-2/"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/resume-org-survey-great-turnover-205000780.html"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs | The AI Journal","url":"https://aijourn.com/resume-org-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs/"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs | | goskagit.com","url":"https://www.goskagit.com/resume-org-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026/article_77ce8840-5cab-5180-b509-78c0ef1c6a1d.html"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: 6 in 10 Companies Plan To Lay Off Employees in 2026 Amid Economic Uncertainty","url":"https://www.streetinsider.com/PRNewswire/Resume.org+Survey:+6+in+10+Companies+Plan+To+Lay+Off+Employees+in+2026+Amid+Economic+Uncertainty/25350491.html"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: 6 in 10 Companies Plan To Lay